THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

Nutrient composition data in `src/game/definitions/items/` is derived from the
USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy and Foundation Foods datasets, which are in the
public domain and carry no restrictions.

Dependencies listed in `package.json` are each under their own licences, held
in `node_modules/` and not vendored into this repository.

The game's design owes an obvious debt to Evolve by Peter Motschmann. Nothing of
its code or assets is used here.
